{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  COLLECTION LIST — "Nossas coleções" (Mater)
  ============================================================

  O QUE FAZ:
  Mostra um conjunto de coleções ESCOLHIDAS pelo lojista (via blocks)
  como cards altos com a foto sangrando, um degradê escuro no rodapé
  e, por cima dele, o nome da coleção em display + o link
  "VER COLEÇÃO →". Acima da grade vai o cabeçalho da seção:
  eyebrow, título grande, subtítulo e um parágrafo de apoio à direita.

  ONDE É USADA:
  Seção reutilizável (tem preset com 4 blocos) — na home, logo abaixo
  do hero. Como tem preset, pode ir em qualquer página pelo editor.

  PRINCIPAIS PARTES:
  - Cabeçalho: eyebrow / heading / subheading e o side_text da direita
    (cada um some se ficar em branco).
  - section.blocks do tipo featured_collection: cada bloco aponta para
    uma coleção. O card usa a featured_image dela.
  - O card inteiro é um link; o "VER COLEÇÃO" é decorativo (não é um
    <a> dentro de outro <a>, que seria HTML inválido).
  - Settings: heading, subheading, eyebrow, side_text, columns_desktop.

  OBSERVAÇÕES:
  - O degradê é um ::after sobre a imagem; o texto fica acima dele
    via z-index, sempre em branco — por isso o contraste não depende
    da foto.
  - Proporção do card fixada em 3/4 (retrato), como no layout.
  - Adicione/remova coleções pelos blocos no theme editor.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="collection-list" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="collection-list__inner">
    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank
      or section.settings.heading != blank
      or section.settings.subheading != blank
      or section.settings.side_text != blank
    -%}
      <div class="collection-list__header">
        <div class="collection-list__intro">
          {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
            <p class="collection-list__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="collection-list__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
            <p class="collection-list__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if section.settings.side_text != blank -%}
          <p class="collection-list__side">{{ section.settings.side_text | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <ul
      class="collection-list__grid"
      role="list"
      style="--grid-columns: {{ section.settings.columns_desktop }};"
    >
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- assign block_collection = collections[block.settings.collection] -%}
        {%- assign card_title = block.settings.title | default: block_collection.title -%}
        <li class="collection-list__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <a href="{{ block_collection.url | default: '#' }}" class="collection-card">
            <div class="collection-card__media">
              {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
                {{
                  block.settings.image
                  | image_url: width: 900
                  | image_tag:
                    loading: 'lazy',
                    class: 'collection-card__image',
                    widths: '300, 450, 600, 900',
                    sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, 50vw',
                    alt: card_title | escape
                }}
              {%- elsif block_collection.featured_image -%}
                {{
                  block_collection.featured_image
                  | image_url: width: 900
                  | image_tag:
                    loading: 'lazy',
                    class: 'collection-card__image',
                    widths: '300, 450, 600, 900',
                    sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, 50vw',
                    alt: card_title | escape
                }}
              {%- else -%}
                {{ 'collection-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'collection-card__image placeholder-svg' }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            <div class="collection-card__content">
              <span class="collection-card__mark">//</span>
              <h3 class="collection-card__title">
                {%- comment -%}
                  Atenção: nada de `card_title | default: 'chave' | t` aqui — o filtro
                  `t` cairia em cima do título já resolvido e devolveria
                  "translation missing". O fallback precisa ser um if.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if card_title != blank -%}
                  {{- card_title -}}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{- 'onboarding.collection_title' | t -}}
                {%- endif -%}
              </h3>
              <span class="collection-card__cta">
                {{- 'sections.collection_list.view_collection' | t -}}
                <span class="collection-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list {
    --mater-gutter: clamp(20px, 6vw, 100px);
    padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 78px) 0 clamp(30px, 4vw, 60px);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__inner {
    padding: 0 var(--mater-gutter);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 60px);
    margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 56px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 clamp(8px, 1vw, 16px);
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.95vw, 1rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display-family);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5.3vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__subheading {
    margin: clamp(10px, 1.2vw, 20px) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.05vw, 1.1rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  /* As quebras de linha vêm do texto (4 linhas); nowrap impede quebras
     extras, e a coluna "auto" do header fica com a largura da maior linha. */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__side {
    margin: clamp(10px, 1.6vw, 26px) 0 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 0.9vw, 0.95rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__side::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 60px);
    height: 1px;
    margin-top: 1.6em;
    background-color: currentColor;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns, 4), 1fr);
    gap: clamp(10px, 1.1vw, 18px);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--cor-branco);
    border-radius: var(--media-radius);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__media {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    background-color: var(--color-background-contrast);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card:hover .collection-card__image {
    transform: scale(1.04);
  }
  /* Degradê que garante o contraste do texto, seja qual for a foto */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__media::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(7, 7, 7, 0.88) 0%, rgba(7, 7, 7, 0.55) 26%, rgba(7, 7, 7, 0) 55%);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__content {
    position: absolute;
    left: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 26px);
    right: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 26px);
    bottom: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 30px);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__mark {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__title {
    margin: clamp(6px, 0.7vw, 12px) 0 clamp(10px, 1.1vw, 18px);
    font-family: var(--font-display-family);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.1vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: inherit;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7em;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 0.85vw, 0.9rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card__arrow {
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-card:hover .collection-card__arrow {
    transform: translateX(5px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 999px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 559px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    /* Em telas bem estreitas deixa quebrar para não vazar da tela. */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .collection-list__side { white-space: normal; }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.collection_list.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "default": "// Coleções", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.eyebrow.label" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "default": "Nossas coleções", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.heading.label" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subheading", "default": "Estilo, fé e propósito em cada detalhe.", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.subheading.label" },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "side_text",
      "default": "Camisetas que vão além\ndo estilo. São expressão\nde uma fé que veste\no seu dia a dia.",
      "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.side_text.label"
    },
    { "type": "range", "id": "columns_desktop", "min": 2, "max": 5, "step": 1, "default": 4, "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.columns_desktop.label" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "featured_collection",
      "name": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.name",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.collection.label" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.title.label", "info": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.title.info" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.image.label", "info": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.image.info" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.collection_list.name",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "featured_collection", "settings": { "title": "São Miguel Arcanjo" } },
        { "type": "featured_collection", "settings": { "title": "Pietrelcina" } },
        { "type": "featured_collection", "settings": { "title": "Calcuta" } },
        { "type": "featured_collection", "settings": { "title": "Acútis" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
